    128  71b8							; setup_room: when the screen changes, the playfield of
    129  71b8							; the room goes into the Superchip RAM (bank 3)
    130  71b8							; - with its door open if it is;
    131  71b8							; - the HUD gets the name of its level; the plug of the
    132  71b8							;   room is chosen;
    133  71b8							; - the plates of the spikes start down, NUSIZ1 of the
    134  71b8							;   room;
